{"c":[{"id":"7848f6afe9cf5adb","sum":"Stockroom backups are warehouse.issue147-<purpose>.duckdb, so delete-if-present never removes a user's .bak. Pytest that imports torch in-process prints nanobind leaks at exit; code unchanged. No torch: none. embed/semantic: none after the Hub-filter fix.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T194525Z-96009f5f2a711415","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: every warehouse backup stockroom or its contributors make is named warehouse.issue147-<purpose>.duckdb in the stockroom home (M2: warehouse.issue147-pre-duckdb2.duckdb), so later delete-if-present code removes only ours, never a user's own .bak.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T202007Z-8202b18ddd62b1e1","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: a pytest process that loads the engine conftest and imports torch in-process (importorskip) prints nanobind leaked-instance lines at exit; exit code unchanged. No torch: none. embed/semantic subprocesses: none after the Hub-filter fix.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4ace2c55b4ea657f","sum":"Inverse torch skips: CLI skips when torch is installed, doctor.py:205 when loaded. Skip counts do not prove they ran; use pytest -rs. DuckDB 2 zstd fails on v1.0.0/v1.1.0, works from v1.2.0; memory stores Uncompressed. No ALTER. v2.1.2 schema-0 leftover is a bare 12288-byte file.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T230859Z-f3b33970b7939cf9","text":"Engine suite has inverse torch skips: test_doctor_cli.py:54 skips when torch is installed, test_doctor.py:205 when torch is already loaded in the worker. Skip counts do not prove torch-gated tests ran; use pytest -rs.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T001340Z-97dfabc9146bc1fb","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: USING COMPRESSION zstd raises BinderException on v1.0.0 and v1.1.0 files, works from v1.2.0; in-memory accepts it (stores Uncompressed). No ALTER sets compression. v2.1.2's schema-0 leftover is a bare 12,288-byte file, no tables.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
